## Loop Nesting at a Glance

```
for i (window start)
  └── count = 0
      for j (each element in window i → i+k)
        └── flag = true
            for o (look back from i to j-1)
              └── if arr[o] == arr[j] → flag=false, break
            if flag → count++
      list.add(count)
```

